# AI Competitor Watch Agent (MERN)

10 companies (Tesla, IBM, Reliance, Microsoft, Google, Amazon, Apple, NVIDIA, OpenAI, Meta) ki recent news dhundta hai,
noise/duplicates hatata hai, category lagata hai, aur ek chhota intelligence brief banata hai.

## Agent kaise kaam karta hai (server/services/)
| Step | File | Kya karta hai |
|------|------|---------------|
| 1 | newsFetcher.js   | Google News RSS se recent articles (free, no API key) |
| 2 | noiseFilter.js   | Irrelevant + clickbait/stock-tip articles hatata hai |
| 3 | deduper.js       | Similar titles merge (Jaccard similarity), "kitne sources ne cover kiya" count karta hai |
| 4 | categorizer.js   | product / pricing / hiring / partnership / financial / legal / leadership / other + importance score |
| 5 | briefGenerator.js| Claude se brief (agar API key ho), warna rule-based brief |
| - | agent.js         | Upar ke saare steps ko jodta hai (companies parallel me chalti hain) |

## Folder structure
```
server/                 Express + Mongoose
  config/companies.js   company list + search query + aliases
  services/             agent ke saare steps
  routes/agentRoutes.js API endpoints
  models/Brief.js       history ke liye Mongo model
  server.js
  test-pipeline.js      fake data se test (internet nahi chahiye)
client/                 React (Vite)
  src/App.jsx           main page, state yahi hai
  src/api.js            backend calls
  src/components/       CompanySelector, BriefSummary, CategoryFilter, UpdateCard
```

## Run kaise kare
Node 18+ chahiye.

**Terminal 1 - backend**
```
cd server
npm install
cp .env.example .env      # (Windows: copy .env.example .env)
npm run dev
```
**Terminal 2 - frontend**
```
cd client
npm install
npm run dev
```
Browser: http://localhost:5173

## .env
- `MONGO_URI` - optional. Nahi hai to bhi chalega, bas history save nahi hogi.
- `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` - optional. Daaloge to brief Claude likhega, warna rule-based.

## API
- `GET  /api/companies`
- `POST /api/agent/run`  body: `{ "companies": ["Tesla","IBM"], "days": 7 }`
- `GET  /api/agent/history`

## Test (bina internet)
```
cd server && npm test
```

## Customize
- Company add karni hai -> `server/config/companies.js`
- Category keywords badalne hai -> `server/services/categorizer.js`
- Noise rules -> `server/services/noiseFilter.js`
